        "custom_liquid_mnWCT9": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  KOSMETIKAL — Cele trei butoane + calculatorul de volum\n\n  Bloc \"Custom Liquid\" în secțiunea Product information, imediat sub blocul \"Buy buttons\".\n  ⚠️ „Show dynamic checkout buttons\" (Buy with Shop) trebuie oprit din blocul Buy buttons.\n\n  Calculatorul citește scara de praguri din:\n    metafield de produs `custom.price_tiers`  →  setarea globală „Volume discount scale\"\n  Format, un prag pe linie:  cantitate = reducere%   (ex. „240 = 16\")\n  Pragurile sub minim sau peste plafon se ignoră; fiecare se rotunjește la multiplul de bax.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign m = product.metafields.custom -%}\n\n{%- assign kk_moq  = m.moq.value | default: settings.kk_moq | default: 10 -%}\n{%- assign kk_cap  = m.max_qty.value | default: settings.kk_cap | default: 500 -%}\n{%- assign kk_mult = m.case_multiple.value | default: settings.kk_case_multiple | default: 1 -%}\n{%- assign kk_mult = kk_mult | plus: 0 -%}\n{%- if kk_mult < 1 -%}{%- assign kk_mult = 1 -%}{%- endif -%}\n\n{%- assign kk_cases = kk_moq | divided_by: kk_mult -%}\n{%- assign kk_exact = kk_cases | times: kk_mult -%}\n{%- if kk_exact < kk_moq -%}{%- assign kk_cases = kk_cases | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}\n{%- assign kk_min = kk_cases | times: kk_mult -%}\n\n{%- comment -%}\n  Ultima treaptă validă sub plafon. Sliderul din panou trece dincolo de plafon,\n  ca să se poată ajunge la ofertă; cel de aici nu, fiindcă peste plafon\n  calculatorul se ascunde și controlul ar dispărea de sub deget în timpul tragerii.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign kk_span    = kk_cap | minus: kk_min -%}\n{%- assign kk_steps   = kk_span | divided_by: kk_mult -%}\n{%- assign kk_capstep = kk_steps | times: kk_mult | plus: kk_min -%}\n\n{%- assign kk_retail = settings.kk_retail_multiplier | default: 3.5 -%}\n{%- assign kk_scale  = m.price_tiers.value | default: settings.kk_price_tiers -%}\n\n<div class=\"kk-cta\" data-kk-cta\n     data-kk-retail=\"{{ kk_retail }}\"\n     data-kk-min=\"{{ kk_min }}\"\n     data-kk-cap=\"{{ kk_cap }}\"\n     data-kk-mult=\"{{ kk_mult }}\">\n\n  <script type=\"application/json\" data-kk-scale>{{ kk_scale | json }}</script>\n\n  <div class=\"kk-cta-row\">\n    <a class=\"kk-btn kk-btn--ghost\" href=\"/pages/contact\">Order sample</a>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-btn kk-btn--solid\" data-kk-design-toggle>\n      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M12 19l7-7 3 3-7 7-3-3z\"/><path d=\"M18 13l-1.5-7.5L2 2l3.5 14.5L13 18l5-5z\"/>\n      </svg>\n      Add design\n    </button>\n  </div>\n\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-btn kk-btn--wide\" data-kk-calc-toggle>\n    Bulk &amp; profit calculator\n  </button>\n\n  <a class=\"kk-btn kk-btn--solid kk-btn--wide\" href=\"/pages/request-a-quote\" data-kk-quote hidden>\n    Request a quote\n  </a>\n\n  <div class=\"kk-drawer\" data-kk-design hidden>\n    <label class=\"kk-drawer-lab\" for=\"kk-file\">Upload your logo or label</label>\n    <input type=\"file\" id=\"kk-file\" name=\"properties[Design]\"\n           accept=\".png,.jpg,.jpeg,.pdf,.ai,.eps,.svg\" data-kk-file>\n    <p class=\"kk-hint\">PNG, JPG, PDF, AI, EPS or SVG &middot; max 20&nbsp;MB</p>\n    <p class=\"kk-hint kk-hint--ok\" data-kk-ok hidden>\n      &check; Attached. Your design is reviewed and confirmed before production.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  {%- comment -%}\n    Fără slider propriu: calculatorul urmează cantitatea din panoul B2B.\n    Un singur control conduce și totalul, și profitul. Scara de praguri e navigabilă.\n  {%- endcomment -%}\n  <div class=\"kk-drawer kk-calc\" data-kk-calc hidden>\n\n    <div class=\"kk-calc-head\">\n      <span class=\"kk-calc-qty\"><b data-kk-cq></b> pcs</span>\n      <span class=\"kk-calc-off\" data-kk-coff></span>\n    </div>\n\n    {%- comment -%}\n      Poartă același `data-kk-range` ca sliderul din panou, deci panoul îl conduce\n      și îl sincronizează fără cod suplimentar aici. Rostul lui e să ai cantitatea\n      la îndemână chiar lângă cifre, fără să dai scroll înapoi în sus.\n    {%- endcomment -%}\n    <input type=\"range\" class=\"kk-range kk-calc-range\" data-kk-range\n           min=\"{{ kk_min }}\" max=\"{{ kk_capstep }}\" step=\"{{ kk_mult }}\" value=\"{{ kk_min }}\"\n           aria-label=\"Quantity\">\n\n    <dl class=\"kk-figs\">\n      <div><dt>Your cost / pc</dt><dd data-kk-cost></dd></div>\n      <div><dt>You save</dt><dd data-kk-save></dd></div>\n      <div class=\"kk-figs-sep\"><dt>Suggested retail / pc</dt><dd data-kk-retail></dd></div>\n      <div><dt>Your revenue</dt><dd data-kk-rev></dd></div>\n      <div class=\"kk-figs-hero\"><dt>Your profit</dt><dd data-kk-profit></dd></div>\n      <div><dt>Your margin</dt><dd data-kk-margin></dd></div>\n    </dl>\n\n    <p class=\"kk-ladder-lab\">Volume scale &mdash; tap a row to jump</p>\n    <table class=\"kk-ladder\"><tbody data-kk-ladder></tbody></table>\n\n    <p class=\"kk-hint\">Indicative figures. Final pricing is confirmed with your order.</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .kk-cta { margin: 1.6rem 0 0; }\n  .kk-cta-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }\n\n  /* `.kk-btn { display: inline-flex }` bate atributul `hidden`, care e o regulă de browser\n     cu prioritate minimă. Fără linia asta, butoanele „ascunse\" rămân vizibile. */\n  .kk-cta [hidden] { display: none !important; }\n\n  .kk-btn {\n    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .8rem;\n    padding: 1.5rem 1.8rem; font-size: 1.4rem; letter-spacing: .04em;\n    text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground));\n    background: none; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground)); text-align: center;\n  }\n  .kk-btn--solid { background: rgb(var(--color-foreground)); color: rgb(var(--color-background)); }\n  .kk-btn--ghost { background: rgba(var(--color-foreground), .06); border-color: transparent; }\n  .kk-btn--wide { width: 100%; margin-top: 1rem; }\n  .kk-btn:hover { opacity: .85; }\n\n  .kk-drawer {\n    margin-top: 1.4rem; padding: 1.8rem;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), .18);\n  }\n  .kk-drawer-lab { display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 600; }\n  .kk-drawer input[type=\"file\"] { width: 100%; font-size: 1.3rem; }\n  .kk-hint { margin: 1rem 0 0; font-size: 1.2rem; opacity: .6; }\n  .kk-hint--ok { opacity: 1; font-weight: 600; }\n\n  /* --- calculator --- */\n  .kk-calc-head {\n    display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;\n  }\n  .kk-calc-qty { font-size: 1.3rem; opacity: .7; }\n  .kk-calc-qty b { font-size: 2.6rem; font-weight: 400; opacity: 1; }\n  .kk-calc-off {\n    font-size: 1.3rem; padding: .3rem 1rem;\n    background: rgb(var(--color-foreground)); color: rgb(var(--color-background));\n  }\n  .kk-calc-off:empty { display: none; }\n\n  /* .kk-range e stilat în blocul panoului; cele două sunt oricum inseparabile */\n  .kk-calc-range { margin: 0 0 1.8rem; }\n\n  .kk-ladder-lab {\n    margin: 2.4rem 0 .8rem; font-size: 1.05rem; letter-spacing: .08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .5;\n  }\n  .kk-ladder { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 1.3rem; }\n  .kk-ladder td { padding: .8rem .4rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), .08); }\n  .kk-ladder td:nth-child(2) { text-align: center; opacity: .6; }\n  .kk-ladder td:last-child { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .kk-ladder tr { cursor: pointer; }\n  .kk-ladder tr:hover td { background: rgba(var(--color-foreground), .04); }\n  .kk-ladder tr[data-on] td { font-weight: 600; background: rgba(var(--color-foreground), .07); }\n  .kk-ladder tr[data-on] td:nth-child(2) { opacity: 1; }\n\n  .kk-figs { margin: 0; font-size: 1.4rem; }\n  .kk-figs > div {\n    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline;\n    padding: .7rem 0;\n  }\n  .kk-figs dt { opacity: .65; }\n  .kk-figs dd { margin: 0; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .kk-figs-sep { border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), .12); margin-top: .6rem; padding-top: 1.3rem !important; }\n  .kk-figs-hero dt { opacity: 1; font-weight: 600; }\n  .kk-figs-hero dd { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 600; }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    .kk-cta-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .kk-figs { font-size: 1.3rem; }\n    .kk-ladder { font-size: 1.2rem; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  /* Dawn re-randează coloana de produs; nimic nu se salvează în variabile,\n     totul se re-verifică periodic, listenerele sunt delegate pe document. */\n\n  var lastKey = null;\n\n  function cta()  { return document.querySelector('[data-kk-cta]'); }\n  function file() { return document.querySelector('[data-kk-file]'); }\n  function money(c) { return '€' + (c / 100).toFixed(2).replace('.', ','); }\n  function money0(c) { return '€' + Math.round(c / 100).toLocaleString('de-DE'); }\n\n  function productForm() {\n    var fs = document.querySelectorAll('form[action*=\"/cart/add\"]');\n    for (var i = 0; i < fs.length; i++) {\n      if (fs[i].querySelector('[name=\"add\"]')) return fs[i];\n    }\n    return fs[0] || null;\n  }\n\n  function ensurePlacement() {\n    var c = cta(), f = productForm();\n    if (!c || !f) return;\n    f.setAttribute('enctype', 'multipart/form-data');\n    if (c.parentElement === f) return;\n    var anchor = f.querySelector('[name=\"add\"]');\n    while (anchor && anchor.parentElement !== f) anchor = anchor.parentElement;\n    if (anchor) f.insertBefore(c, anchor); else f.appendChild(c);\n  }\n\n  function unitCents() {\n    var el = document.querySelector('[data-kk-unit]');\n    if (!el) return 0;\n    var n = parseFloat(el.textContent.replace(/[^\\d,.]/g, '').replace(',', '.'));\n    return isNaN(n) ? 0 : Math.round(n * 100);\n  }\n\n  /* Scara de praguri: text „cantitate = reducere%\" pe linie.\n     Se rotunjește la multiplul de bax, se taie la [minim, plafon], se deduplică. */\n  function tiers() {\n    var c = cta(); if (!c) return [];\n    var min  = parseInt(c.dataset.kkMin, 10);\n    var cap  = parseInt(c.dataset.kkCap, 10);\n    var mult = parseInt(c.dataset.kkMult, 10) || 1;\n\n    var raw = '';\n    try { raw = JSON.parse(c.querySelector('[data-kk-scale]').textContent) || ''; } catch (e) {}\n\n    var out = [];\n    raw.split('\\n').forEach(function (line) {\n      var m = line.match(/(\\d+)\\s*=\\s*(\\d+(?:[.,]\\d+)?)/);\n      if (!m) return;\n      var q = parseInt(m[1], 10);\n      var d = parseFloat(m[2].replace(',', '.'));\n      if (mult > 1) q = Math.ceil(q / mult) * mult;          // aliniere la bax\n      if (q < min || q > cap) return;\n      out.push({ q: q, off: d / 100 });\n    });\n\n    // Crescator dupa cantitate; la cantitati egale, discountul mare intai.\n    out.sort(function (a, b) { return a.q - b.q || b.off - a.off; });\n\n    // Doua trepte pot cadea pe aceeasi cantitate dupa alinierea la bax\n    // (12 si 24 devin amandoua 24 la bax de 24). O pastram pe cea avantajoasa.\n    out = out.filter(function (t, i, a) { return i === 0 || t.q !== a[i - 1].q; });\n\n    if (!out.length || out[0].q > min) out.unshift({ q: min, off: 0 });\n\n    return out;\n  }\n\n  function currentQty() {\n    var qi = document.querySelector('[data-kk-qty]');\n    var n = qi ? parseInt(qi.value, 10) : NaN;\n    return isNaN(n) ? 0 : n;\n  }\n\n  /* reducerea aplicabilă la o cantitate = ultimul prag atins */\n  function tierAt(qty, ts) {\n    var t = ts[0];\n    for (var i = 0; i < ts.length; i++) if (qty >= ts[i].q) t = ts[i];\n    return t;\n  }\n\n  function paint() {\n    var c = cta(); if (!c) return;\n    var base = unitCents(); if (!base) return;\n    var ts = tiers(); if (!ts.length) return;\n\n    var qty = currentQty(); if (!qty) return;\n    var t   = tierAt(qty, ts);\n\n    var retailX = parseFloat(c.dataset.kkRetail);\n    var retail  = Math.round(base * retailX / 100) * 100;    // FIX — același raft la orice volum\n    var cost    = Math.round(base * (1 - t.off));\n    var revenue = retail * qty;\n    var profit  = revenue - cost * qty;\n\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-cq]').textContent     = qty.toLocaleString('de-DE');\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-coff]').textContent   = t.off > 0 ? '−' + Math.round(t.off * 100) + '%' : '';\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-cost]').textContent   = money(cost);\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-save]').textContent   = t.off > 0 ? money0((base - cost) * qty) : '—';\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-retail]').textContent = money(retail);\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-rev]').textContent    = money0(revenue);\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-profit]').textContent = money0(profit);\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-margin]').textContent = Math.round(profit / revenue * 100) + '%';\n\n    var rows = c.querySelectorAll('[data-kk-ladder] tr');\n    for (var i = 0; i < rows.length; i++) {\n      if (parseInt(rows[i].dataset.q, 10) === t.q) rows[i].setAttribute('data-on', '');\n      else rows[i].removeAttribute('data-on');\n    }\n  }\n\n  function build() {\n    var c = cta(); if (!c) return;\n    var ts = tiers(); if (!ts.length) return;\n    var base = unitCents(); if (!base) return;\n\n    var key = ts.map(function (t) { return t.q + ':' + t.off; }).join(',') + '|' + base;\n    if (key !== lastKey) {\n      lastKey = key;\n      c.querySelector('[data-kk-ladder]').innerHTML = ts.map(function (t) {\n        var cost = Math.round(base * (1 - t.off));\n        return '<tr data-q=\"' + t.q + '\">'\n             + '<td>' + t.q.toLocaleString('de-DE') + ' pcs</td>'\n             + '<td>' + (t.off > 0 ? '−' + Math.round(t.off * 100) + '%' : '—') + '</td>'\n             + '<td>' + money(cost) + '</td></tr>';\n      }).join('');\n    }\n    paint();\n  }\n\n  /* --- interacțiune --- */\n\n  document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    var c = cta(); if (!c) return;\n    if (e.target.closest('[data-kk-design-toggle]')) {\n      var d = c.querySelector('[data-kk-design]'); d.hidden = !d.hidden;\n    }\n    if (e.target.closest('[data-kk-calc-toggle]')) {\n      var k = c.querySelector('[data-kk-calc]'); k.hidden = !k.hidden;\n      if (!k.hidden) { lastKey = null; build(); }\n    }\n    /* click pe un rând din scară → mută cantitatea din panou acolo */\n    var row = e.target.closest('[data-kk-ladder] tr');\n    if (row) {\n      var qi = document.querySelector('[data-kk-qty]');\n      if (qi) {\n        qi.value = row.dataset.q;\n        qi.dispatchEvent(new Event('input', { bubbles: true }));\n        qi.dispatchEvent(new Event('blur',  { bubbles: true }));\n      }\n    }\n  });\n\n  /* calculatorul urmează cantitatea din panou — un singur control conduce tot */\n  document.addEventListener('input', function (e) {\n    if (e.target.matches('[data-kk-qty], [data-kk-range]')) paint();\n  });\n\n  document.addEventListener('change', function (e) {\n    if (!e.target.matches('[data-kk-file]')) return;\n    var c = cta(); if (!c) return;\n    var has = e.target.files && e.target.files.length > 0;\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-ok]').hidden = !has;\n    var f = productForm();\n    var label = f && f.querySelector('[name=\"add\"] span');\n    if (label) label.textContent = has ? 'Add to cart with my design' : 'Add to cart';\n  });\n\n  /* API-ul AJAX de coș al Shopify NU acceptă fișiere. Cu design atașat, ocolim\n     handlerul lui Dawn și facem submit nativ. form.submit() nu declanșează\n     evenimentul \"submit\", deci Dawn nu intervine. */\n  document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (!e.target.closest('[name=\"add\"]')) return;\n    var fl = file(), f = productForm();\n    if (fl && fl.files && fl.files.length > 0 && f) {\n      ensurePlacement();\n      e.preventDefault();\n      e.stopImmediatePropagation();\n      f.submit();\n    }\n  }, true);\n\n  /* Peste plafon: butoanele de comandă se ascund, rămâne o singură rută. */\n  function applyCap() {\n    var c = cta(); if (!c) return;\n    var p = document.querySelector('[data-kk-panel]');\n    var qIn = document.querySelector('[data-kk-qty]');\n    if (!p || !qIn) return;\n\n    var cap  = parseInt(p.dataset.kkCap, 10);\n    var qty  = parseInt(qIn.value, 10);\n    var over = !isNaN(qty) && qty > cap;\n\n    c.querySelector('.kk-cta-row').style.display = over ? 'none' : '';\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-calc-toggle]').style.display = over ? 'none' : '';\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-quote]').hidden = !over;\n    if (over) {\n      c.querySelector('[data-kk-design]').hidden = true;\n      c.querySelector('[data-kk-calc]').hidden   = true;\n    }\n\n    var f = productForm();\n    var add = f && f.querySelector('[name=\"add\"]');\n    if (add) {\n      var wrap = add.closest('.product-form__buttons') || add.parentElement;\n      if (wrap) wrap.style.display = over ? 'none' : '';\n    }\n  }\n\n  setInterval(function () {\n    ensurePlacement();\n    applyCap();\n    var c = cta();\n    var k = c && c.querySelector('[data-kk-calc]');\n    if (k && !k.hidden) build();     // prinde schimbarea de variantă\n  }, 200);\n\n  ensurePlacement();\n})();\n</script>\n"
          }
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "share": {
          "type": "share",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "share_label": "Share"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "vendor",
        "title",
        "price",
